Tests that type qualifiers and static within array brackets
in parameter declarators are handled correctly (C11 6.7.6.3p7):
const prevents parameter modification, restrict/volatile are preserved,
static records minimum size, and type compatibility is maintained
between declarations with and without qualifiers.
